{"id": "7798", "revid": "1822", "url": "https://en.wikivoyage.org/wiki?curid=7798", "title": "Clovis", "text": "There is more than one place called Clovis:\nUnited States of America.\nThe Clovis Culture is the most important known culture in North America from before 10,000 BCE. It is named after an archeological site near the New Mexico town."}
